ay:inline-block; width:auto; background:#0064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; line-height:1.2; margin:0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; text-transform:none; padding:14px 32px 14px 32px; border-radius:100px; box-sizing:border-box\">Read the recap</a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-40px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\"><strong>That's a wrap on Meta Connect! </strong>Check out everything we covered in one place, from developer sessions and recap blogs to updated documentation for our AI models and products, VR, AI glasses and Horizon.&nbsp;</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-0px-50px-0px-50px img-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:0px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div style=\"margin:0 auto\"><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZU3Vu8FsJihG0me1WkdyDQA9EnlhDbcQh3Br2G_RUqVwc6AqbJsIj-gZ7fbCayqRIwZwDNjOxF6g1TB3uB503fLhsUytrulMwz7-Q\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#0068A5\"><img alt=\"Meta Connect 2026\" height=\"auto\" width=\"700\" src=\"https://client-data.knak.io/production/email_assets/5e501bf6edcaa/r3DvtIxwNGNWJNrZsknR8fiuTBKyFjDfrAtbFYQ8.png?utm_source=email:6aab343e7457e\" style=\"border:none; border-radius:24px; outline:none; text-decoration:none; height:auto; width:100%; font-size:13px; display:block\"></a></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-30px-50px-0px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:24px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">Start here</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-10px-50px-0px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 0px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><ul class=\"ul-b519ec20-b6ca-11f1-b6f4-dbe03caccccf\" style=\"display:block; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; padding-left:40px; list-style-type:disc\"><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:20px\">AI models and products: Muse Spark brings multimodal intelligence to code, physical action and video-heavy work. Muse Code adds the reliability and auditability you need to ship it as production code. <a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZVfoaSVNMJywysoImN_VmtIE5kDwUbHdssH3dsvKhD67RQHrspP7z5JcK346cFB-FSSlgWHI1tqpEz0ciBIAnq6-KM_T3r9PoOIkk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:rgb(0,104,165); text-decoration:underline\">Dive in</a>.</li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\">VR: Meta VR Glasses arrive in 2027, and you can start building for them today with the v207 SDKs and the simulators you already use. <a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZWYnXssXZbKhTUUG-k8zsDtB2C72AUwCzvSYZPJ7Mhv3uS0s_M-341LrO6KA9ySplio4qrUsSt6sGAPEBGcpWO-VnINfSCax7Bk1A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:rgb(0,104,165); text-decoration:underline\">Learn how</a>.</li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\">AI glasses: Whether you build mobile, web or AI-first, your work has a path onto AI glasses, display or displayless, plus new surfaces where people can discover it. <a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZXBveLNN9F1RKDCdR_PE6feEtTMVHFyou4kKklAHPVNkMA4e1p_JPWkICYguggduSfF_fWz67P1tXApgVSKzPgS3jwaErHAMU_R3w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:rgb(0,104,165); text-decoration:underline\">Start building.</a></li><li style=\"padding-left:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:20px\">Horizon: Horizon Create and Horizon Studio turn any idea into a polished 2D or 3D game, built on your phone or in your browser and ready to publish across Facebook, Instagram and Horizon. <a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZYoRYDCVaykOlwkbq6Ut3lTspFqQUAlrT-KqtqYKUZii8uwL2MjMtZLcSHPZb71mazo-j4plRXuqZz3lUKgnfxW7eI4nu6zwAkCKc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:rgb(0,104,165); text-decoration:underline\">Be among the first to try them.</a></li></ul><div style=\"display:none\">&nbsp;</div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"padding-20px-50px-20px-50px text-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:20px 24px 20px 24px; word-break:break-word; text-align:left\"><div class=\"links-0068A5-underline\"><div style=\"font-family:'Optimistic Text',Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; font-weight:normal; letter-spacing:none; line-height:1.8; text-align:left; color:#1C2B33\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 0px 0\">We can’t wait to see what you build.&nbsp;</p></div></div></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"middle\" class=\"padding-40px-15px-40px-0px button-container\" style=\"font-size:0px; padding:10px 0px 30px 0px; word-break:break-word; text-align:center\"><div><a href=\"https://click.digital.metamail.com/?qs=ABB7InYiOjEsImQiOjUwMDl9AAoAAAAABPzcC4ZZwfVexPqgMnVXyp6IGekTOkEJIJK9iEYy1gdD_uawHbnIKTDRoB_Za9obUcvKwuthPROIxVW82FprOGFk4inHk3Z6WQs93erD1xI\" target=\"_blank\" width=\"291\" style=\"display:inline-block; width:auto; background:#0064E0; color:#ffffff; font-family:'Optimistic Display',Helvetica,sa