  "body_text": "Sessions on demand, recap blogs and the latest documentation.\n\n                                                    ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏  ‍͏  ͏ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­ ͏‌ ­ ­ ­ ­\n\nCatch up on\n\nMeta Connect\n\nRead the recap\n\nThat's a wrap on Meta Connect! Check out everything we covered in one place, from developer sessions and recap blogs to updated documentation for our AI models and products, VR, AI glasses and Horizon.\n\nStart here\n\nAI models and products: Muse Spark brings multimodal intelligence to code, physical action and video-heavy work. Muse Code adds the reliability and auditability you need to ship it as production code. Dive in.\n\nVR: Meta VR Glasses arrive in 2027, and you can start building for them today with the v207 SDKs and the simulators you already use. Learn how.\n\nAI glasses: Whether you build mobile, web or AI-first, your work has a path onto AI glasses, display or displayless, plus new surfaces where people can discover it. Start building.\n\nHorizon: Horizon Create and Horizon Studio turn any idea into a polished 2D or 3D game, built on your phone or in your browser and ready to publish across Facebook, Instagram and Horizon. Be among the first to try them.\n\nWe can’t wait to see what you build.\n\nWatch Meta Connect sessions\n\nThis message was sent to purchasing@sesameaccess.com . If you don’t want to receive these emails from Meta in the future please unsubscribe.\n\n© 2026 Meta. Meta Platforms, Inc., 1601 Willow Rd. Menlo Park, CA 94025 or where the Meta Products are offered to you by Meta Platforms Ireland Limited, 4 Grand Canal Square, Grand Canal Harbour, Dublin 2, Ireland\n\nPlatform Policy Privacy Policy Terms Unsubscribe",
